@paymentsUrl = http://localhost:5151
@accessToken = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_DE_SESION
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@customerSessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@customerAccessToken = REEMPLAZAR_DESDE_DINING_QR

### Crea datos: sustituya orderId por un pedido entregado o cobrable
POST {{paymentsUrl}}/api/payments/orders/{{orderId}}/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "method": "Card",
  "externalReference": "HTTP-PAYMENT-01"
}

### Reembolsar el pago capturado
POST {{paymentsUrl}}/api/payments/orders/{{orderId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Prueba de reembolso desde Payments.Api.Write.http"
}

### Pago Online de cliente QR; puede responder 425 mientras RabbitMQ proyecta el pedido
POST {{paymentsUrl}}/api/payments/orders/{{orderId}}/capture-customer-qr
X-Customer-Session-Token: {{customerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "diningSessionId": "{{customerSessionId}}",
  "externalReference": "HTTP-CUSTOMER-QR-01"
}
